{{also|afhverju}}
==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|is|afhverju}} (''[[abbreviation|abbr.]]'')
* {{l|is|akkuru}} (''slang'')

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|af||of}} and {{m|is|hverju}} the dative of {{m|is|hvað||what}}.

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverb|head=[[af]] [[hver]]ju}}

# [[why]]?
#: {{syn|is|hvers vegna|hví}}
#: {{ux|is|Mamma, '''af hverju''' er himininn blár?|Mommy, '''why''' is the sky blue?}}
#: {{ux|is|'''Af hverju''' viltu fara til Spánar?'' — ''[[af hverju ekki|'''Af hverju''' ekki]]?|'''Why''' do you want to go to Spain? — [[why not|'''Why''' not]]?}}
#: {{ux|is|'''Af hverju''' mætirðu ekki í veisluna?|'''Why''' won't you go to the party?}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|af hverju ekki}}?
* {{l|is|sitt af hverju}} (a bit of [[everything]], this and that)
* {{l|is|sitt af hverju tagi}} (of different kinds)

